  unicatt: `MUR, "Procedure per l'ingresso ... anno accademico 2026-2027", Allegato 1 §6 (https://universitaly-private.cineca.it/uploads/universitaly-pubblico/Allegato_1-Circolare_2026_2027.pdf): "Il Diploma di Baccellierato Internazionale ... consente l'accesso alla formazione superiore in Italia purchè il titolo finale ... soddisfi i seguenti requisiti generali: almeno 24 punti in sei materie a scelta, 12 dei quali dovranno essere ottenuti a “Higher Level”; positivo superamento delle tre materie principali: TOK, CAS e EE." No subject is named. `,
  czechia: `The programme's admission section (SIS "Podmínky přijetí" at Charles, "Přijímací řízení" at Masaryk, the faculty admissions page at VŠE, ČVUT and VUT) lists a completed secondary education with maturita or equivalent, the entrance exam or assessment, and proof of Czech/Slovak or English where taught in it. No school-subject prerequisite: each page was searched for maturita- or IB-subject conditions and the only ones found are exam waivers. Czech law makes faculties publish all admission conditions (zákon 111/1998 Sb., §49).`,
